#ifndef RANDO_MERGESHIP_UNIFIED_SEED_H
#define RANDO_MERGESHIP_UNIFIED_SEED_H

// MergeShip2 -- the unified randomizer (one seed over Hyrule and Termina, generated by SoH's generator), on 2Ship's
// side: Shipwright/mergeship2/docs/UNIFIED_RANDO_DESIGN.md, milestone M2.
//
// SoH writes one MERGESHIP_SEED JSON (include/mergeship/MsItems.h); its "mm" section is exactly a 2S2H spoiler body,
// which ApplyToSaveContext applies as it applies any spoiler file. This randomizer never generates in merged mode.
// Items of the seed that 2Ship has no RandoItemId for arrive as the proxies RI_OOT_* (Types.h, from
// include/mergeship/MsItems.def): finding one records it for the host's shared inventory (M3) instead of giving a
// native item.

#include <cstdint>
#include <filesystem>
#include <string>
#include <vector>
#include <nlohmann/json.hpp>
#include "Rando/Types.h"

// The seed. In mergeship.exe every trip from Hyrule says which unified seed the Hyrule file plays, if any
// (MsTransfer.unifiedSeed / unifiedSeedFile, MS_TRANSFER_FLAG_UNIFIED_SEED; SoH records the file with the Hyrule save):
// OnSeedTransfer keeps that in memory (never in the config, so a vanilla Hyrule file's Termina stays vanilla), and it
// wins over the CVar below. Until a trip has said anything (2ship.exe, or a session that never came through the door),
// the user can name a seed file with the CVar, for testing: an absolute path, or a file in the randomizer folder. While
// a seed is named, a new file is a randomizer file of that seed.
#define MERGESHIP_UNIFIED_SEED_CVAR "gMergeShip.Rando.SeedFile"

struct MsTransfer;

namespace Rando {

namespace MergeShip {

// A proxy for an item of the other world (RI_OOT_*).
bool IsProxy(RandoItemId randoItemId);
// A check gave a proxy: logged and remembered. Delivery (the native give here, the ledger for Hyrule) is
// UnifiedDelivery.h's (M3).
void OnProxyObtained(RandoItemId randoItemId);
// Proxies found and not yet taken by the host, oldest first; TakePending empties the list.
std::vector<RandoItemId> TakePendingProxies();

// A merged seed is named: by the last trip from Hyrule (even when its file cannot be found: creating the file then
// fails loudly instead of making a vanilla one), or by MERGESHIP_UNIFIED_SEED_CVAR if its file exists.
bool HasMergedSeed();
// The named seed's "mm" section, validated (a seed named by Hyrule must be that seed: "mm" finalSeed == unifiedSeed);
// throws std::runtime_error with the reason otherwise.
nlohmann::json LoadMergedSeed();
// The named seed's file ("" none, or not found). A trip's seed whose file is missing is looked for by its seed in the
// randomizer folder.
std::filesystem::path MergedSeedPath();

// MergeShipHost_OnResume: what a trip from Hyrule says about the unified seed (MS_TRANSFER_FLAG_UNIFIED_SEED).
void OnSeedTransfer(const MsTransfer* arrival);
// A trip from Hyrule named a unified seed; `seed` is it (SoH ctx->GetSeed() == "mm" finalSeed == ledgerSeed).
bool HostNamesSeed(uint32_t* seed = nullptr);
// MergeShipHost.cpp Boot(): Termina's file `fileNum` (0-2, read into `save`) belongs to a Hyrule file that plays a
// unified seed but is not that seed's randomizer file (a vanilla file made before the seed reached Termina, or another
// seed's). If so, and the seed's file is at hand, the old file is set aside (saves/fileN_notunified_<time>.json, with a
// notification) and true is returned: Boot creates the file again, as a randomizer file of the seed.
bool RetireStaleTerminaFile(int32_t fileNum, const void* save);
// MergeShipHost_OnResume: the Termina file in play is not the named seed's randomizer file and the seed's file is at
// hand, so the arrival boots the file again (and Boot remakes it) instead of carrying on with it.
bool LoadedFileNeedsSeed();

// Harness (MergeShipHostTest.cpp): "unifiedseed [check <RandoCheckId>]" -- the seed Termina knows, the file's save
// type and finalSeed, and the item the file holds at a check.
bool SeedTestCommand(const std::string& op, const std::vector<std::string>& args);
// `seed` is a MERGESHIP_SEED: its validated "mm" section. Throws when the seed was made from another item table.
nlohmann::json UnwrapSeed(const nlohmann::json& seed);
bool IsMergedSeed(const nlohmann::json& file);

} // namespace MergeShip

} // namespace Rando

#endif
